{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想為手機聯絡人留一份可靠又私密的備份，ContactVault Pro 以全本機處理的方式完成任務，無伺服器、無雲端、無追蹤，通訊錄不會離開裝置。它適合準備換機的用戶、需要加密匯出聯絡資料的專業人士，以及重視私隱、只接受本機處理的人。程式原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，可於 App Store 下載。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-205.webp\">\n<h2>本地加密備份通訊錄</h2>\n<p>ContactVault Pro 支援一鍵備份，把聯絡人匯出為 VCF 或 CSV 檔案，方便跨平台匯入或於試算表編輯。備份檔可加入 AES-256 加密與密碼保護，並以 Face ID 或 Touch ID 驗證，適合需要處理敏感資料的用戶。程式內置備份紀錄與每日、每週或每月提醒，資料僅在裝置本機處理，不上傳伺服器、不作追蹤。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-358-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-359-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-360-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-361-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：ContactVault Pro</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T05:58:46.215262+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":382,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T05:43:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T12:17:35.778626+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T05:57:40.976629+00:00","content_hash":"a0f9d028911b2ee1402281c080d50b05cef4c32a3fe5e1a86ce2b6443e7302ec","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}